     --connect-project` runs. They reference the artefacts the connect script
     installed. -->

| **research-wiki MCP server** | `.mcp.json` `mcpServers.research-wiki` | Programmatic access to the second brain via MCP. Available tools: `wiki_gateway_orient`, `wiki_gateway_query`, `wiki_search`, `wiki_read_page`, `wiki_status`, `wiki_methodology_guide`, `wiki_gateway_contribute`, ~28 total. |
| **gateway forwarder** | [tools/gateway.py](tools/gateway.py) | CLI access to the second brain's gateway. `python3 -m tools.gateway orient`, `query`, `compliance`, `health`, `template`, `flow`, `contribute`. |
| **view forwarder** | [tools/view.py](tools/view.py) | CLI access to the second brain's view tool. `python3 -m tools.view spine`, `model <name>`, `lessons`, `standards`, `search <query>`. |
| **second brain root** | `{{second_brain_path}}` | Where the research wiki lives on this host. The forwarders dispatch here with `cwd={{second_brain_path}}`. |
